BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventrelease26renewal3ahuntersmoonanightoffiremagic26intention26257-20261026@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261026T164239Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:Release & Renewal: Hunter's Moon a Night of Fire\, Magic\, & Intention
DESCRIPTION:Release & Renewal: Hunter’s Moon. An Evening of Fire\, Magic\, & Intention. As autumn deepens and the Hunter’s Moon illuminates the night\, join us for a magical evening of reflection\, release\, and renewal. Embrace the powerful symbolism of the Full Moon as we gather to let go of what no longer serves us\, reconnect with our inner wisdom\, and set meaningful intentions for the journey ahead. Through a guided Full Moon meditation\, sacred fire ceremony\, and Moon Oracle card guidance\, you'll be invited to explore what you are ready to release\, what your soul is seeking\, and what you wish to welcome into your life. Add a little witchy magic by creating your own Hunter’s Moon Intention Pouch\, filled with carefully selected herbs\, botanicals\, and symbolic treasures. You'll also receive a personal Moon Oracle message and a special ritual to continue your practice at home. Release • Seek • Claim Come embrace the magic of the Hunter’s Moon in an intimate\, welcoming circle of connection\, intention\, and transformation. No previous experience is necessary. Just bring an open heart and a willingness to embrace a little magic! Space is limited. Advance registration is required.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/release-%26-renewal%3a-hunters-moon-a-night-of-fire-magic-%26-intention/26257/
END:VEVENT
