SUMMARY:Songwriter's Workshop - October
DESCRIPTION:Are you a musician looking for inspiration/feedback? Or\, maybe you’d just like the chance to perform your newest song! Oh boy\, have we got the event for you. Join us for another one of our free songwriting workshops presented by Braindead Live! with the opportunity to perform your song(s)! Workshop signups at 6:45PM. BYO instrument(s) and creativity! PS. Even if you are not interested in participating in the workshop\, this will be a fun\, free event where you\, as an audience member\, will have the opportunity to watch a musician’s creative journey from inception to performance!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/songwriters-workshop-october/26209/
