BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcatenazapatawinepairingdinner3aaneveninginargentina26275-20261029@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261026T164239Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:Catena Zapata Wine Pairing Dinner: An Evening in Argentina
DESCRIPTION:A little Argentina. A beautiful glass of wine. And a dinner designed around every pour. Join us at Spacie Gracie for an intimate evening featuring Catena Zapata wines\, thoughtfully paired with a specially prepared dining experience. Throughout the evening\, you’ll sip\, taste and discover the wines of Catena Zapata while enjoying food selected to complement each pour. Whether you already love Argentine wine or simply love a great dinner with a story behind it\, this is an evening meant to be savored. Come hungry. Come curious. We’ll pour the wine. THE EXPERIENCE — $85 PER PERSON To reserve your seat\, you’ll pay just $15 through Eventbrite. That $15 is applied directly toward your $85 experience — it is not an additional charge. $15 to reserve your seat today+ $70 at the dinner= $85 total Seating is limited and advance reservations are required. 21+ to consume alcohol. A valid physical ID is required. Raise a glass\, discover something new\, and spend the evening with us at Spacie Gracie. Cheers!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/catena-zapata-wine-pairing-dinner%3a-an-evening-in-argentina/26275/
END:VEVENT
