SUMMARY:Planet Claire: A Sci-Fi Go-Go Musical with Music by the B-52s
DESCRIPTION:ABOUT: MET's original musical returns in partnership with Theatre FCC. Claire\, a waitress\, is longing for something of importance in her life. After her job takes a turn of the worse\, Claire finds herself in the midst of a car wreck and is transported to another planet where she is greeted by aliens who look as if they are members of the B-52s. PERFORMANCE LOCATION: This performance is held at Frederick Community College in the JBK Theatre. MET & Theatre FCC Presents PLANET CLAIRE: A SCI-FI GO-GO MUSICAL Music by The B-52's Book by Tad Janes With Additional Material by Gené Fouché & Tim King
