DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
SUMMARY:Good Trouble Troubadours
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to get into some more good trouble! We’re doubling up this month with another Good Trouble Troubadours show. If you saw them on the 8th\, you know what to expect. Now that we’re even closer to the midterms\, it’s more important than ever to make a plan. We’re talking PROMOTE THE VOTE\, and we want to see everyone out there voting on November 3rd! What better way to get in the mood than with another night of original\, high-energy protest music? By the soundtrack of the resistance\, PROMOTE THE VOTE!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/good-trouble-troubadours/26200/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventguidedexhibittours25817-20261030@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261026T164239Z
